     since without an output specified, ffmmttmmssgg() is unable to do anything use‐
     ful.

     In order for ffmmttmmssgg() to output to the system console, the effective user
     must have appropriate permission to write to _/_d_e_v_/_c_o_n_s_o_l_e.  This means
     that on most systems ffmmttmmssgg() will return MM_NOCON unless the effective
     user is root.

